  (text "Proteksi baterai (tanpa modul BMS):\n1. F301 sekring: short circuit (hardware).\n2. HY2213 per cell: bleed ~100mA saat cell > 4.20V (balancing + batas overcharge per cell).\n3. Firmware STM32: baca tap (CELL_B1..4) dan NTC; cell < 3.0V / > 4.25V / suhu di luar 0-45C\n   -> matikan DSG_EN / CHG_EN (Q301/Q302). Default OFF saat MCU mati.\n4. BQ25713: BATOVP total pack, watchdog, batas arus input.\n\nSW301 harus sesuai SW201 (sheet charger): 4S semua OFF, 3S pos1, 2S pos1+pos2." (at 246.38 193.04 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.52 1.52)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "a19004f0-7341-593b-96b8-8f5eb49a1737")
  )
)
